"# F1 Histories of making\n\nThe first Foundations module. It teaches a global history of making as a web of objects, makers, places, routes and institutions. Its threshold concept is that design history is a web with obscured strands, not a line. F1 has 35 units at structure v3.6. Gate G1 passed on 28 September 2026. Phase 4 is under way, and spec batch 1 (eight units) was written on 29 September 2026.\n\n## What is here\n\n| Folder | Contents |\n|---|---|\n| `docs/` | The module's documents, in order, as Markdown and PDF (listed below) |\n| `specs/` | Unit specs on template v3, one Markdown file per unit; these are the authoring sources for the batch-1 doc |\n| `grouping-pages/` | Five grouping pages from round 2: the Indian Ocean, the Indus Valley civilisation, the waqf, Arts and Crafts, the Middle Horizon. The first three (Mingei, Nok, Igun Eronmwon) are inside the Groundwork document |\n| `atlas/` | The Atlas data and its jobs: the canon register (4,228 nodes), the world-set, claims and practices registers, 198 zero-cost source routes, 130 primary texts, the harvesters, validation, coverage and the licence switch. See `atlas/README.md` |\n",
"| `briefs/` | The briefs research agents worked to: canon schema and codes, grouping pages, unit specs |\n| `research/` | Studies behind decisions: licensing routes, object-type density, how civilisations and movements are treated, the round-2 blind map, the AP-250 coverage check, licence verification notes |\n| `review-logs/` | Fact-check logs for the canon, including the lint fixes of 29 September |\n| `design/mockups/project/` | The mockups (version 4): nine artboards and the canvas file. They need the Design runtime to render, so open them from the live mockups link below |\n| `exports/` | The canon register as a workbook, for reading without code |\n| `build/` | The scripts that built the canon and registers, kept as a record of method. They ran once in a scratch workspace, and their input and output paths point there |\n\n## Documents, in the order they were made\n\n| # | Document | Files | Live |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 01 | F1 Pass 2, v1 | [md](docs/01-pass-2-v1/index.md) · [pdf](docs/01-pass-2-v1/index.pdf) | [open](https://claude.ai/artifact/3rnb6jRGHAYc2wq2TkyEeD) |\n",
